# 统一换行符，避免 Windows / macOS / Linux 之间来回提交产生假 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须是精确的 CRLF 字节流（start.bat / pack.bat 还是 GBK 编码），
# 交给 git 转换会破坏 cmd 解析，所以标记为「不做任何转换」
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text

# 二进制资源不做换行转换
*.zip   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf   binary
*.db    binary
